The current OpenDash source distribution excludes motorcycle-dashboard pairing,
authentication, projection, streaming, hardware control, and dashboard-wallpaper
playback implementations. The retained application is focused on independent
phone-app features including route preview, vehicles, maintenance, garage,
expenses, ride history, themes, and downloadable phone wallpapers.

